field            layer          sd_w n_eff 30 deg n_eff 60 deg   vs incumbent
DIC (TCO2)       deep        53.8814         23.3         10.2     CONSISTENT
DIC (TCO2)       surf        71.9581         41.4         43.3    better det.
d13C             deep         0.3274         23.5         10.2     CONSISTENT
